%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
## Animation
Let's animate the motion of our triple pendulum. Initially, we will use points for the joints of the pendulum connected by a black line. The graphics itself is relatively simple, i.e. a few connected lines, points, the number of moving points remains the same. This means, that `Animate` can animate it smoothly out of the box and involve Just-In-Time optimizations:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Animation
Let's animate the motion of our triple pendulum. Initially, we will use points for the joints of the pendulum connected by a black line. The graphics itself is relatively simple, i.e. a few connected lines, points, the number of moving points remains the same. This means, that `Animate` can animate it smoothly out of the box and involve Just-In-Time optimizations:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Animate[
  Graphics[
    {
      {
        Directive[TransitionType->None],
        {Gray, Opacity[0.25], Line[trajectories[[3, ;; Floor[t / 0.05] + 1]] ]},
        {Red, Opacity[0.15], Line[trajectories[[2, ;; Floor[t / 0.05] + 1]] ]},
        {Blue, Opacity[0.15], Line[trajectories[[1, ;; Floor[t / 0.05] + 1]] ]}
      },
      
      Black, 
      Line[{{0, 0}, {xC[t, 1], yC[t, 1]}, {xC[t, 2], yC[t, 2]}, {xC[t, 3], yC[t, 3]}}],
      Blue, PointSize[0.03], Point[{xC[t, 1], yC[t, 1]}],
      Red, PointSize[0.03], Point[{xC[t, 2], yC[t, 2]}],
      Green, PointSize[0.04], Point[{xC[t, 3], yC[t, 3]}] 
    },
    
    PlotRange -> {{-3, 3}, {-3, 3}},
    Prolog->{Line[{{-3,0}, {3,0}}]},
    Axes -> True,  Frame->True,
    Background -> White, 
    ImageSizeRaw -> {450,450}
  ], 
  {t, 0, timeMax, 0.05}, 
  
  RefreshRate -> 30 
]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
By default, __Graphics__ smooths the motion of lines and points, which might lead to some artifacts for continuous lines representing the full trajectory of each joint. Therefore, we explicitly disable it in **Directive** for them.

<br/>

### Extras
Here is another version of it with pictures placed on a graph instead of basic points:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
By default, __Graphics__ smooths the motion of lines and points, which might lead to some artifacts for continuous lines representing the full trajectory of each joint. Therefore, we explicitly disable it in **Directive** for them.

<br />

### Extras
Here is another version of it with pictures placed on a graph instead of basic points:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
ico = (*VB[*)(FrontEndRef["8b049d7d-d9ab-4a67-a50c-19a72ab7f93c"])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KRCeEJBwK8rPK3HNS3GtSE0uLUlMykkNVgEKWyQZmFimmKfoplgmJumaJJqZ6yaaGiTrGlommhslJpmnWRonAwCK1hYH"*)(*]VB*);
nico = ColorNegate[(*VB[*)(FrontEndRef["8b049d7d-d9ab-4a67-a50c-19a72ab7f93c"])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KRCeEJBwK8rPK3HNS3GtSE0uLUlMykkNVgEKWyQZmFimmKfoplgmJumaJJqZ6yaaGiTrGlommhslJpmnWRonAwCK1hYH"*)(*]VB*)];

Animate[
  Graphics[
    {      
      Directive[TransitionType->None],
      Line[{{0, 0}, {xC[t, 1], yC[t, 1]}, {xC[t, 2], yC[t, 2]}, {xC[t, 3], yC[t, 3]}}],
      Inset[nico, {0,0}],
      Inset[ico, {xC[t, 1], yC[t, 1]}],
      Inset[ico, {xC[t, 2], yC[t, 2]}],
      Inset[ico, {xC[t, 3], yC[t, 3]}]
    },
    
    PlotRange -> {{-3, 3}, {-3, 3}},
    Prolog->{Line[{{-3,0}, {3,0}}]},
    Axes -> True,  Frame->True,
    Background -> White, 
    ImageSizeRaw -> {450,450}
  ], 
  {t, 0, timeMax, 0.05}, 
  
  RefreshRate -> 30 
]

